{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"ccb18c2e-1c96-435b-9c06-b2ceaa982121":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__ccb18c2e-1c96-435b-9c06-b2ceaa982121-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Dry Area Anti Fatigue Mats"}},"template--14486268149889__ccb18c2e-1c96-435b-9c06-b2ceaa982121-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Anti-fatigue mats help reduce strain and improve productivity in the work place<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__ccb18c2e-1c96-435b-9c06-b2ceaa982121-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486268149889__ccb18c2e-1c96-435b-9c06-b2ceaa982121-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f2508fd0-10a9-4a82-b01d-921a80544445":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_102_349c4814-74e7-4fd9-b47a-1dfa2541c0fb.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"DURA FLEX 150","text":"<p>These interlocking Anti-Fatigue Mats are made of rubber with small air pockets designed to allow air flow and evaporation of moisture from underneath the mat. These mats are ideal for indoor areas with heavy activity, such as gyms and warehouses.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.55\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy dura flex 150 mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-flex-150-comfort-stand-interlocking-anti-fatigue-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"3240f766-eb16-413b-9546-39bf4fd79bf3":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_104_ca86c87f-9374-4a7a-90ac-5ceb66ae7d2d.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"DURA FLEX 200 ANTI-FATIGUE BUBBLE MATS","text":"<p>These Anti-Fatigue Bubble Mats are made of molded rubber which provides a comfortable non slip surface that provides users relief from hard flooring. These heavy duty mats are made to withstand rigorous use in industrial areas.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy dura flex 200 anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-flex-200-anti-fatigue-bubble-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"6b86426b-dc06-42ec-b04c-711471d094a0":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__6b86426b-dc06-42ec-b04c-711471d094a0-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"light duty foam mats"}},"template--14486268149889__6b86426b-dc06-42ec-b04c-711471d094a0-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>These foam mats provide extra cushion and comfort underfoot<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__6b86426b-dc06-42ec-b04c-711471d094a0-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486268149889__6b86426b-dc06-42ec-b04c-711471d094a0-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_103_f3f44bbb-1e63-4321-ac7b-e68bcffd722f.png","image_width":450,"title":"ULTRA TREAD ANTI-FATIGUE MATTING","text":"<p>This anti-fatigue matting is made of coated vinyl foam that is dense, yet soft, to create a comfortable surface underfoot. It has a pebble finish and is perfect for industrial and commercial applications.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$3.15\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy ultra tread anti-fatigue matting","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/ultra-tread-anti-fatigue-matting"}},"template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_105_ddde9208-4f3a-4fa0-98c0-90d2aabbe701.png","image_width":450,"title":"FATIGUE FIGHTER II ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>These mats are constructed of two layers, a solid vinyl surface and a vinyl foam, to create a comfortable surface underfoot. The embossed vinyl surface texture prevents the mats from collecting dirt and debris.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy fatigue fighter II mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/fatigue-fighter-ii-anti-fatigue-mats"}},"template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_106_768798ff-3f40-4bba-9ab5-fe409574e9d7.png","image_width":450,"title":"SUPER CUSHION ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>Super Cushion Anti-Fatigue Mats are constructed of two layers, a solid vinyl nitrile and a vinyl nitrile foam, to create a comfortable and durable surface underfoot. These mats are perfect commercial and industrial environments.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy super cushion anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/super-cushion-anti-fatigue-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486268149889__d6d22656-2403-4616-823a-7b607d8f13b2-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"03e7fa4c-6da4-4e62-9637-adcddd173e77":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_107_a7fd5189-4e2f-46bd-8590-38813b4f221a.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"DIAMOND PLATE ANTI FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>These exceptionally durable mats feature a diamond pattern and offers slip resistant and anti-fatigue qualities. Available in a Brite version which features a semi-reflective top surface.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$19.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy diamond plate anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/diamond-plate-anti-fatigue-mats-2","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"72ad4834-6e86-4c40-a8d1-af550924df11":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__72ad4834-6e86-4c40-a8d1-af550924df11-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Heavy Duty Anti-Fatigue Mats"}},"template--14486268149889__72ad4834-6e86-4c40-a8d1-af550924df11-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>These durable anti-fatigue mats are ideal for commercial and industrial applications.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__72ad4834-6e86-4c40-a8d1-af550924df11-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486268149889__72ad4834-6e86-4c40-a8d1-af550924df11-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/A1-B_309e4933-3914-4dbc-a4b9-0754f6b788a1.png","image_width":450,"title":"Safe-Flex Anti-Fatigue Mat","text":"<p>These mats are made with interlocking fire resistant recycled PVC tiles with an anti-slip domed texture. They have a patented anti-fatigue support structure that will hold up under the harshest of conditions.<br\/><br\/><\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$20.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy  Safe-Flex Anti-Fatigue Mat","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/safe-flex-anti-fatigue-workstation-kit"}},"template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_108_0d6c91fe-a01d-43bf-ade5-70c52ac18f36.png","image_width":440,"title":"rhino hide anti-fatigue mat","text":"<p>These mats feature a high-gloss pebble surface built for the toughest environments and a super resilient base which provides exceptional buoyancy to reduce fatigue. These mats are perfect for commercial environments.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$19.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy rhino hide anti-fatigue mat","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/rhino-hide-anti-fatigue-mat"}},"template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Reflex_Anti-Fatigue.webp","image_width":450,"title":"Reflex Anti-Fatigue Mat","text":"<p>Featuring a buoyant polymer sponge and vertical column support domes, these mats offer both slip-resistant and anti-fatigue qualities. These mats are designed to provide comfort and relief from fatigue.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$26.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Reflex anti-fatigue mat","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/reflex-anti-fatigue-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486268149889__51782911-3d26-4bf2-b986-5fd3aaf547a2-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"a320b778-34d1-444e-929e-493a2f7fe270":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__a320b778-34d1-444e-929e-493a2f7fe270-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"stylized anti-fatigue mats"}},"template--14486268149889__a320b778-34d1-444e-929e-493a2f7fe270-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Match your work space flooring with these anti-fatigue mats for a seamless fit<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__a320b778-34d1-444e-929e-493a2f7fe270-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486268149889__a320b778-34d1-444e-929e-493a2f7fe270-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_111_0fea9800-cfd6-492a-abbd-ffb2dfaf5b0a.png","image_width":450,"title":"MARBLEIZED TILE TOP ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>A matting that provides standing comfort for workers, these mats come in a variety of marble tile designs and offer plenty of value with its high puncture resistance and durability.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$19.75\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy marbleized anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/marbleized-tile-top-anti-fatigue-mat"}},"template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_112_51abc316-f5ce-47d6-aed9-50e0a531ee59.png","image_width":450,"title":"SOFTWOODS ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>Soft Woods Anti-Fatigue Mats combine an attractive wood-grain finish with the comfort of high quality soft foam to produce a mat that is as good looking as it is comfortable. Match your work flooring with this anti-fatigue solution.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$18.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy softwoods anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/softwoods-anti-fatigue-mats"}},"template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_120_a29ddd46-55e4-4465-87ad-04ad45564349.png","image_width":450,"title":"TUFF PLUSH ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>Tuff Plush provides resistance to punctures from heels, cart traffic tears and cuts and is permanently bonded to an industrial grade sponge base, delivering unparalleled comfort.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$30.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy tuff plush anti fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/tuff-plush-anti-fatigue-mat"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486268149889__44fad718-7d23-4f08-9d9c-fc192af86822-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"9882121c-a27c-4a7f-96b6-b50426608e7e":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__9882121c-a27c-4a7f-96b6-b50426608e7e-167803304369c6fd79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"interlocking anti-fatigue mats"}},"template--14486268149889__9882121c-a27c-4a7f-96b6-b50426608e7e-167803304369c6fd79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>These modular interlocking anti-fatigue mats are versatile and allow you to tailor your own work space.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__9882121c-a27c-4a7f-96b6-b50426608e7e-167803304369c6fd79-0","template--14486268149889__9882121c-a27c-4a7f-96b6-b50426608e7e-167803304369c6fd79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_116_c3da7ea0-046d-462f-b743-9d1d5c34ea34.png","image_width":450,"title":"CUSHION-EASE SOLID MATS","text":"<p>Cushion-Ease Matting is a resilient interlocking anti-fatigue mat with an anti-slip surface texture and multi-nib backing to further enhance the ergonomic support of the mat.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$11.67\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy cushion-ease solid mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cushion-ease-solid-mats"}},"template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_115_a3f3310c-84eb-48af-a280-99cc0ffaf18b.png","image_width":450,"title":"CUSHION-EASE ERGO mats","text":"<p>These interlocking anti-fatigue mats are made out of resilient rubber and feature an anti-slip bubble top surface texture.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$18.89\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy cushion-ease ergo mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cushion-ease-ergo"}},"template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_117_4c8761fb-7714-435e-aaff-4f3d5525196c.png","image_width":450,"title":"STAND EASY MATTING","text":"<p>A versatile anti-fatigue matting, the Stand Easy is a safe, clean, comfortable and fatigue-free interlocking solution for your work space and employees.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.44\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy stand easy matting","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/stand-easy-matting"}}},"block_order":["template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-0","template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-1","template--14486268149889__28d000b9-5ade-4e88-b110-b1eeca8430c4-16780335464e3da5f7-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"18585b40-cd51-4c7e-8b7b-bcb3fd8ba86a":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--144